## Documentation Status

The documentation in this knowledge base is automatically generated from structured JSON data.

### Status Legend

- **pending**: Document awaiting documentation generation
- **generated**: Documentation has been generated and is up-to-date
- **outdated**: Source document has changed since documentation was generated
- **error**: Documentation generation failed - review required

### Regenerating Documentation

To regenerate documentation, use the Maestro CLI:

```bash
# Regenerate all pending documentation
node tools/maestro-cli/index.js docs process

# Regenerate specific collection
node tools/maestro-cli/index.js docs process --collection models

# Force regenerate all documentation
node tools/maestro-cli/index.js docs rebuild
```

